# first_dialogue

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"
cast ALEX
  .label "Alex"
cast MAREN
  .label "Maren the Keeper"

-- meeting

WREN
  The bell went silent three days ago.
  Nobody has been up to the tower since.
  I'm asking you to look.

ALEX { wary }
  And who's asking?

WREN { quiet }
  A friend of Maren's.

ALEX
  Then I'll go.
